| Detection Metadata                                                                    |
| ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| Detection Name    : DNS/HTTP Beacon-like Traffic                                      |
| Detection ID      : DET-008                                                           |
| MITRE Tactic      : Command & Control                                                 |
| MITRE Technique   : T1071.001 (Web), T1071.004 (DNS)                                |
| Severity          : Medium                                                            |
| Data Sources      : Sysmon Event 22 (DNS), Sysmon Event 3 (Network)                 |

================================================================================
PRIMARY QUERY — HTTP Beacon Pattern (Periodic Connections)
================================================================================

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
EventID=3
NOT Image IN (
    "*\\chrome.exe","*\\firefox.exe","*\\msedge.exe","*\\iexplore.exe",
    "*\\OneDrive.exe","*\\MsMpEng.exe","*\\svchost.exe","*\\SearchApp.exe"
)
NOT DestinationIp IN ("192.168.10.0/24","127.0.0.1")
| bucket _time span=1h
| stats count AS conn_count,
        dc(DestinationPort) AS port_variety,
        values(DestinationPort) AS ports
  BY _time, Image, DestinationIp, ComputerName
| where conn_count >= 5 AND port_variety <= 2
| eval detection="Beacon-like HTTP Traffic — Periodic Single-Dest Connections"
| eval mitre="T1071.001"
| eval severity="Medium"
| sort -conn_count

================================================================================
SECONDARY QUERY — DNS Beacon Pattern (Periodic Queries)
================================================================================

index=endpoint sourcetype="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational"
EventID=22
NOT Image IN ("*\\chrome.exe","*\\firefox.exe","*\\msedge.exe","*\\svchost.exe")
| bucket _time span=1h
| stats count AS query_count,
        dc(QueryName) AS unique_domains,
        values(QueryName) AS queried_domains
  BY _time, Image, ComputerName
| where query_count >= 10 AND unique_domains <= 3
| eval detection="Beacon-like DNS Traffic — High Frequency Single-Domain Queries"
| eval mitre="T1071.004"
| eval severity="Medium"
| sort -query_count

================================================================================
KNOWN FALSE POSITIVES
================================================================================
- Cloud sync agents (OneDrive, Dropbox — excluded above)
- Telemetry/analytics agents with regular check-in intervals
- Windows Activation and licensing services
- Antivirus cloud lookup services
